  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd0b324bfbfed214404c7ffa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘位于后方时,在最终直线处\\n稍微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "e29ae9b690cedf425e5f33a89882aebf727c5cd31269ab3f4ccebad6b4f0c12c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900841"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900841"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:829124695f50ecb2530b7f44",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "冷静地进行比赛,突入终盘时位于后方附近时\\n稍微向前突进,并略微威慑从领头开始\\n至多4名赛马娘",
      "source_fingerprint": "c09901fff9dac45f9fd6c8cec750f3cfc4ee2ab224a79793e62ec24da7e3d656",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900851"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900851"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23a60b84b208cded7a609b42",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "剩余1000m时若位于前方\\n则稍微加快速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1b90efc70a69afe2a6e776ca8d5633d57f9996b987c59abf4b06d7b3005ddf4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900861"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900861"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12dd5bd4a4a813a8b8e59315",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "剩余400米\\n位于前方并被后方马娘紧追时\\n略微容易突围",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0c383d412b4a66b0f43119d87fa586e7b87d4626bacadcb7cb93b06ebaba1af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900871"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900871"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aca63c49f8e88ce7f83aa97f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终弯道位于队伍中间时\\n比赛剩余400m后速度稍微提升\\n若是中距离赛在中盘有过赶超\\n则速度少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fe638dc15ce4915247fbf7cd4e21614f5314d60af23973cde809b62b0ec8013",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900881"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900881"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:553a6a79f9d163a3e81a11ce",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段左右若位于前方\\n则速度稍微提升,并回复极少量体力\\n如果比赛距离在2400m及以上\\n回复量增加",
      "source_fingerprint": "53ec715ad3805624938c975a576c1ba9e9272d302f791607e081464ea3b74ec0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900891"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900891"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99d8f76053410ed9581a04cc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛前半段的弯道位于前方时,短时间内\\n速度稍微提升,若是英里或中距离比赛\\n则在之后终盘的最终直线被后方逼近时\\n较短时间内极小幅向前突进＜草地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "639fc3738e286d864f5fd6af8297b2698e75bc6546745e8f7f38849bf576734a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900901"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900901"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:395ab05c1db3fc659486e147",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "进入终盘最终直线时若位于队伍中间\\n则剩余300m之后速度略微提升\\n如果能冷静地进行比赛\\n则速度少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bfbe5c93f15370d58d67b9fcd56525279ed18605ae1cfb87a87720f66302503",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900911"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900911"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b0c459c3377f51012980ca3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段附近处于优势位置时\\n速度会小幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "30329228a8a089d6a16b8aef0e497af22b61c25527e75fd59bb08f8251f4529e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900921"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900921"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:439b412ae2a28cf4898a541d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "终盘初段的某处位于前方时\\n略微向前突进,若是短距离或英里比赛\\n则提升技能效果",
      "source_fingerprint": "1baf9615539b1dfeee0d04677767df766b2c7b181a2477aa28cc3097cad13fd2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900931"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900931"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:276182deee1e70ef3e69dbc4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛进行一半时位置处于中间梯队\\n则速度稍微提升,若是中距离比赛\\n则速度少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "25e089e34d1350404abb6a51625d5c457a6b8a94123befa2d9d7bfd234aff7f7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900941"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900941"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51c1c13371a7a6410a820957",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛进入终盘时若位于前方\\n会极小幅向前冲出，在短距离比赛中\\n则会持续极小幅向前冲出\\n直到抵达终点＜作战·先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e5b2e89914d98406aa037fc230c0acace3496848de2299c29ba9e821570433c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900951"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900951"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b811bc662947c1b03940ba8e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段的第3弯道位于队伍中间\\n则短时间内速度稍微提升\\n之后在终盘的最终直线准备超越时\\n速度极小幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d83e26bb6921eaf9c50dd1bf8db71d537d75fbfd38a7fa9e68b20f8f62759da",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900961"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900961"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ae53bf64029dbd4155132ca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "剩余300m的位置处在中游位置时\\n速度少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "d42cdc8f6f02c0722a290f9188a98981cd489fd5a360309b199b9d1a7426ae95",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900971"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900971"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47f25f11164471554829c0f9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在临近终盘的某处\\n微量提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "d12ca5bca2d0a8b081434481f5fedc0aeae6d28ab432226f2bf5314ca1a8012d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900981"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900981"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c24d79a6633c540dfe477f58",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "沙土比赛时在中盘的弯道上竞争过后\\n在最后冲刺时处于好位置\\n加速度会微量上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c20562bb6d876c97c0922914ce9269e2c20d0a762a8fd5e0396e8db7d63920b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "900991"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/900991"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b676420027f407368623d8a6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "剩余300m时位于前方,则速度微量提升\\n若在沙土比赛中与领头赛马娘距离较近时\\n再略微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "42662462baf660bb509c11d0ff9f469207acb1d7a8a77e5d8ec357e16ffed574",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4e8bcd61e3bd25806046cc8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛前半段在队伍中间且前方或后方\\n长时间有赛马娘紧贴,则回复极少量体力\\n之后在比赛中段附近的直线处\\n短时间内速度少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "e69cde92d15b4a56474e83f2f78275c3f6dce3901c3cd9913dc1d5c5bf7a6004",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901021"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901021"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5066e1e3b444bb879eb8a68",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于前方竞争时\n持续一段时间略微提升速度\n此外若正在进行比拼，之后\n持续一段时间极微小向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5ebe9558ab75a334534f3cf92f1d8806ac6fe51ae4873689661228601a9b916",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901031"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901031"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9dbb570d77c0d6455b7f861f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第三弯道位于领头时,速度微量提升\\n并回复微量体力,若是东京竞马场\\n中距离比赛则增加技能持续时间",
      "source_fingerprint": "26d3d3ba0a692dc0c32bd76b6249cc428f2189bbac341e3437e429d68fdf2ea4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901041"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901041"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40fa6ffe92ebfe3c73768457",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段左右处在中间集团\\n速度稍微提升,若是中距离比赛,且至此为止\\n发动过7次技能,则速度会稍稍提高",
      "source_fingerprint": "e67c681835c4dfe3c5f23b1569c6019790708136fd28b5ef004a2ea2b0a99432",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901051"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901051"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3050e016da05a6f6c0e9ae0b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终弯道后半部分位于队伍中间时\\n速度持续微量提升,且在长距离比赛\\n低人气的情况下,速度持续少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "c296fca3a5018155026bf6c6dd12ad5df411d9a6781a4ce3097023a7ee818423",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901061"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901061"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0240d89bbafb51a7a1a5eca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终直线位于领头时\\n速度略微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "12c2fafe1a64ef7008a340fba28195d64ba98cf329c44723c4c5f594afd3d4bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901071"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901071"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd889238b4b3b4992610258a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中段位于后方时速度稍微提升\\n之后在终盘的最终弯道处\\n准备超越时\\n短时间内极小幅向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "54e53787eb005a571a3c0e97d583a22cd6546c01e664ce2b78395c69aceafc65",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901081"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901081"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14999d089eca5bc76e249655",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛前半段的弯道若位于队伍中间\\n则略微提升速度,若是短距离或英里比赛\\n则变为略微持续提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "aea879c2609869699c14af09cdca8beeacf6914dda7379f1ef51706f4a295a52",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901091"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901091"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1675a8df4ccebef393436a1f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛剩余800m自身位于队伍中间\\n则短时间内极小幅向前突进并提升极微加速度\\n若是根干距离的比赛且自身位于后方\\n则额外提供极少加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "986da772d70807aed67f11a2382d6e8abe1fc1f82e2df8467f9705614eb297d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901101"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901101"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b42ab85a2f87e75111df5046",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中段附近位于队伍中间时\\n微量持续性提升速度,若当前位于上坡则提高效果量",
      "source_fingerprint": "ade072b97753874656a289550f27a5c3b77758040550b6ebcc1e436fa09f95ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5254d03cb3d48e19ec413a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当进入比赛最终冲刺阶段时\\n速度在短时间内微幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "104f834902f557642dbafe84dfe988b9e52204eff795b1676d83df04a3c5ac83",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901121"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901121"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c0598c2b09b667d11ab81d4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛前半段的弯道若位于好位置\\n则速度稍微提升,若是2200m的比赛则速度持续稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "261bc5c3ffd2df34c770536de220a94c4f56fc6698dbe85adc34c46755397bc5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901131"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901131"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39ae65b7fbe81deed672f91b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中间点位于队伍中部或更后方时\n少许向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a6620cd61424ad86137ab9ee1124d63494390aca126b667bc014ec7fe948e25",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901141"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901141"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:430e5e24d716ccbb7425d54a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "剩余1000m的位置向前持续极小幅突进＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0863f964c33815c39163fcf91228aab00c5985ddd4cc00176e2ff1247f67a7d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901151"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901151"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccc283deb1659c9f7491bb55",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛前半段的弯道位于前方时\\n速度微量提升,之后在终盘的最终直线\\n位于队伍前方,则短时间内速度少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "a37f23341909446c19af9998a627a4ad1344b6d7feb097b42b22486de0ececa3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901161"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901161"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a13e1a6f39138f4d1108c45b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若比赛中盘以及往后完成超越\\n进入终盘的最终直线时短时间内速度稍微提升\\n若作战为追赶且比赛中盘以及往后完成3次及以上超越\\n则变为短时间内速度提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa80a7dfeba2c1dbe7ff3d97dd26ef40a81f30f29731ebe45789cd67de012748",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901171"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901171"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ccba9494a90cca3649d6d7e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段附近速度稍稍提升\\n在草地中距离比赛中\\n若技能发动时处于队伍中列或之后\\n则较长时间持续微弱提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0d55cebf5195495b182fbe516cb7df4506afc10775ea95b334fd84c588f643c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901181"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901181"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efe4b776825ed467b90c71bb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "冲进终盘时位于后方且距离终点尚远\\n则短时间内向前极小幅突进\\n如果是中山竞马场或阪神竞马场的中长距离比赛\\n则之后在直线上短时间内向前小幅突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "b80a340c4ed4b38eefed7440d871fda0487d6ff1981942419948727761033011",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901191"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901191"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd808ecf73e5a047a696b141",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第4浪时若位于前方则短时间\\n稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "1597abb42f590f0ef8a992b6669f8a0557334bdc94879f0cb68590a92aefff83",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901201"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901201"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beaf239bb71a76a46eb705a7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终弯道完成赶超后\\n在最终冲刺时速度稍微提升\\n若在短距离和英里比赛发动技能时\\n自身位于队伍中间,则变为速度少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "a505e0988e0cf2084cd3b9fbf22501d8e54aa297bf8a600c7cdb64ffa26519f6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51568504adf777ca2df9a236",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "临近终盘的某处若位于前方\\n则略微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b6bbdc62f5722c11c65dc17d39ac6fd48cbba55595baa045f1efb0263169f9c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901241"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901241"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02bbdb70f9835bdc45cd2409",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段的直线处位于中间位置时\\n速度稍微提升\\n若是长距离比赛则提升效果量",
      "source_fingerprint": "552c8a62298742ecd97073236b0a3a5933ec32a418622a0d40b40ac9484c58cb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901271"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901271"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:128186de9c47e116a078ea68",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在中盘弯道位于前方时\n短时间内少量向前突进＜草地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "92a62934a5af8cde2ea6b9a918d65aa20d58043cf5820fca97b41ca2c6e4f7cf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901291"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901291"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39fcc35f1ca13da05bf00320",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在剩余1000m处若身处前方\\n速度微幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "c188e4996c16d1ac0d07701ca307f5f08423e11056a1dde348554fa6ea4793ef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901301"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901301"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba51e8d832df94651eec5033",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中间位于中后方时\\n短时间内稍微向前突进,若是短距离英里比赛\\n则之后最终冲刺时短时间内小幅向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "7996a8cb760fd37fbd19d8f1d0453b208400a19145a747f7f2b09bfd799e6add",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901311"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901311"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fdb9d5d7e0e8e298564b309",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "临近终盘的某处速度极小幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb028d70dbb44b6ed7fafcb33935131c0380db172af30fcec3481b9c95178cfb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901321"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901321"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acef03571d396fb266f61a1f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段附近短时间内速度微量提升＜先行・草地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f6af0f3a70b111ee4360d85749834ee4d2551980ca8f48c4235beb4edbf7d36",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901331"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901331"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40c9199a4e7b063f97d033eb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于前方时\\n若附近有2名以上的赛马娘\\n则持续稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "f669ea20327e10cd73c03b7784daffa1a78023aa417a752c5af7de81e33bfbec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901341"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901341"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17f14a01d8da71c489b75a48",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段持续少许提升速度\n若是2000m以上的比赛，\n之后会在最后冲刺阶段短暂少许提升加速度<居中/后追>",
      "source_fingerprint": "f01d2fe88835e23e56ccfc4487e705bf297a4dae1a22336c639903a5ff0359af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901351"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901351"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7f6513df26d3a269fb94235",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "终盘位于中团及以后且余力充足时\\n稍微向前突进＜英里/中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "97f2561e206e9e3bce91ebeefece98f7a85604ce8d0d90f42f33c60e828c3c0a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901361"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901361"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b2094a7f81107f8cf0ab9dc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中盘初期位于中团及以前时长时间\n持续略微向前突进<中距离/长距离>",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8c098352ce9265096443d8300e6064f9e3402f3b2da8802fd9c1b95d8251b65",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901371"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901371"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84b90d90320c4b0ee81ce2b9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段一段时间内稍微提升速度\\n若是2000m以上的比赛,则在此之后\\n于最后冲刺阶段短暂地\\n稍微提升加速度＜领放/先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d731df6584bc720d008180d3268ab0e19ba756776c3e150ccca6698ccb6af1d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901411"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901411"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c25e29bf0b6d2662b32f1c98",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "进入中盘时若身处后方,在临近终盘时\\n微幅向前突进,若是中距离比赛,之后\\n进入最终直线时若身处前方,则\\n极微幅向前突进＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "508a42600d904ed86e628e25e8cbe4f8edc12f9162658fd48478d782a9c0bc97",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901431"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901431"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6423e01a1a01cd2a6555926",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "起跑顺利的话\\n长时间持续稍微向前突进\\n＜先行/追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d11eefdc8f5f9f6405f510f1a795fe1ee0977738fa0b150c8a05c954fcd3fc66",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901451"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/901451"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca0018f673dd898a77091582",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时如果使用了两次技能\\n且位于队伍中间时\\n回复少量体力并略微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff95432ee4396cbe2a213642947985b3cc30db65f6ac74215d7927ac5e00bfb1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/910011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eaa440f0e3328ca382de9c00",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "进入终盘处于领头位置时极小幅度向前突进\\n若此时为第三弯道并且中盘拉开巨大差距\\n领先时,稍微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "27058c182d280a7719156ed89191229e80aa26a92406de0545e8b4859b51c4aa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910021"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/910021"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cf046b00b00d53ca145e3f0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后\\n位于前列穷追不舍时\\n会在最终直线稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "84ff87156efc45103954327a8488e3132595ee618f7d3579821844825274cc5a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910031"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/910031"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ef719f3b40daefce026828d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若使用技能回复过体力\\n且比赛后半程在队伍前方时\\n速度微微上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "934d9e4c9958b88f3d979cbb880e1c333b951fba6a0a5d7b4d536b295222399e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910041"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/910041"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98b9b286b3894db9ac534bda",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终弯道后,在先头集团突围时\\n短时间速度稍微加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0198ac361ceab11e5511b85a507c94120732a31743cb9c01143e1e70f68bd88",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910051"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/910051"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18670bef5f867ad782fab75d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若使用技能回复了3次以上的耐力\\n则会在比赛后半稍微调整一下呼吸\\n朝着胜利向前迈进",
      "source_fingerprint": "afd73ffed1d865d48a1d8d84d2bf5b65f1bc50de3337e287f3f3ae4fc2d8ef40",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910061"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/910061"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:794da406223f9f49b5dfda2c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段的某个地方微量提升速度\\n并且无视条件\\n发动一个可以使用的金技能",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcadb4baec70384861a217c88433605dc186dd182d209c7132edd1c12beb62cd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910071"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/910071"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbdf8e892c2ed48ee4b4216b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛进入中盘之后在下坡时位于中间集团\\n则下完坡后在短时间内速度少量提升\\n如果位于东京竞马场则再次推高档位",
      "source_fingerprint": "927d02d7bc12d251617b53072ae6ada4065e1fbeb005e3286ccdc2bba7009a41",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910081"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/910081"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18d581f7c372c7decce7ac9d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段的直线位于前方时速度微量持续上升\\n位于领头位置并与后方马娘距离较近时\\n技能效果提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "7930fd35f41c7331d54f1e82691983b76b172c4e7e2b7a7945dd9457ae6ab70b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910091"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/910091"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdaca60275055ee5d199340b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "剩余200m处位于队伍前方时略微提高速度\\n若此时距前方赛马娘较近时\\n略微向前冲刺一点点",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a41d093713014d2522d87e30bc227f389fde3def825ce4af9174bc564e7bd8b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910101"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/910101"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:845d0854999340413cb0c67b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘处于后方且名次下降时\\n以温柔的治愈之光回复持久力",
      "source_fingerprint": "f106c184e3ae3900bb21a4dbe925cc9dbde3beb9811e6e80479233ea41bc65ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/910111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b66e3f40d156582d5a5c6680",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘完成三次追赶,在临近终盘的下坡路\\n位于后方时,短时间内速度稍微提升\\n并提升极少量加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "89cf3c87670c7ce02e4a0a3e95aedbabe847d74455793afc474fdc9893438669",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910121"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/910121"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f1e2421efd2349f988e9d94",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘最终弯道处于前方时被超越时\\n速度持续稍微上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "95abf8bd3a1b24df6cf11e8f206cffcf4b0e1df27b2928b01b4080812e217dd7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910131"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/910131"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45650b7b9db84d386d893cff",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终弯道时从队伍中团向前移动时\\n灵魂会沸腾燃烧,稍微加速能力",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3cd69b948445221c1feea4d59e1c83fe11465144f5ace6e62a36ac55a38e515",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910141"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/910141"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55cb3aaaa88b8e9d30d7f54f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "距终点400米的位置身处前方时速度稍微提升\\n若是比赛中合计使用过7次技能\\n变为小幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "d42fec8e2e92f8e5b1d48a5f325706a90d1605baed24faae1b46bb1fb66f8ba5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910151"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/910151"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bf8dcc6601fb5962b6b77a9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘的最终弯道后半处位于前列时\\n速度略微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "106bd77ddfd9b9002f86929103b81392384beefce272c36f62a618ce9b8c2e09",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910161"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/910161"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e341714ae4c28500fe6a2094",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘身处前方,有被反超的危险时\\n会在最终弯道前使速度持续稍微上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "0540085668e79c7983c432f496c09d96e99a289357ce45d23830a61594299e99",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910171"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/910171"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70644879fa22e414d8437b5d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若比赛中盘处于队伍前方\\n并开始追逐前方的马娘的话\\n则速度上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "a077a613de4d74d3c4cfe31e0fa4e01a43e40a03e4c547f1c927d32af23f2b89",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910181"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/910181"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33105e7c1cf66e0fbc6c16d9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在中盘的弯道位于中间集团往后的位置\\n且附近有3名及以上的马娘时\\n速度少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "55316ce56d1ba74220423daffa5be2c87160572d7c85ba37cac9fd6e8bd61b7f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910191"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/910191"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f4a7f10867e424ca9f796a0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘的直线身处前方时,会稍微提\\n升速度。若这恰巧也是看台对面\\n跑道,还会一并略微提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8fe27c23508083b0ad210bb0c51a84f21a1ae0a6afc1b960f4d2d377d01a0fb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910201"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/910201"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4663e93cef21c26858d393cb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘发动两次技能时\\n速度微量持续上升,若在效果持续中继续发动技能\\n会提升效果速度量,最大两次",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8c1c13a342d8a44fa8ba9c88cf1560af638acd79192c1094360b6b638d45c75",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/910211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2666db5d2386b85e77722e7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "终盘最终弯道往后处于好位置时提升速度\\n若距离终点尚远\\n则会略微提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "d96d88db82ca425ae91d8876a0e1957839201a8af6341e08f29adebfcdcfb00c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910221"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/910221"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a78eb04f51a0b60432e2827f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若自比赛开始直到后半为止\\n能一直处于良好的位置\\n则比赛中盘时速度会上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "001a5671dfe61f46f5b27ae93778f1a11563d1e82f6b7379cfea75ecb9b17004",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910231"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/910231"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e3d7a27e4bdb2a5ba90498f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道前\\n在前方完成超越时稍微提升速度\\n在后方完成超越时则稍微提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "db81f479d01bb0055e25e45678e1e3e6e9eaf7d37146cf2cedb4f4fd0e55a32a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910241"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/910241"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9ee7b69edc885eae94ddc76",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛前半段若一直位于队伍中后方\\n则在比赛终盘的最终弯道以及往后\\n向前极小幅突进\\n如果是长距离比赛则增加效果量",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebac0bd5a9487482f138016233483a55f53c5fbdc419f79da137c27d2d7ecad6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910251"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/910251"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c591d9e4df4e62e4544a5b32",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在中盘弯道处于前列、\\n检测到后面有其他马娘时\\n则会微量回复体力,且速度略微上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "4846d2cb8deba83e0257446dfd27f60bf2df1569a91d45ee9ff20a2fb19573e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910261"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/910261"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fa48e5dcf6c56d6c51acd8a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "临近终盘的下坡处在第二名开外距离领头4马身\\n以内时,短时间内速度略微提升\\n中距离比赛则额外略微提升少量加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c60c3aa4e3f177d8be854bf7bf85184e359f636c62ecb82349b5b46ad45ef02",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910271"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/910271"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3053c29a76f3a97b6e59c38b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "临近中盘的某一刻处于优势位置时\\n会在短时间内小幅提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "22720e869c3e08598d64595857e61aa1c65922bec5ce7d0a01af0fbe81375aa3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910281"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/910281"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94a2e87396bcd1defa4cbfce",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中段附近在前方开始加速时\\n短时间内略微提升速度\\n若是英里比赛\\n则增加速度量",
      "source_fingerprint": "c210b74fd042bca01143886ae8774bce860a13604242ff2e821cb712e21093af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910291"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/910291"
    }
  ]
